@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

<https://w3id.org/tib/datacite/vocab/resourceTypeGeneral/Text> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://www.dublincore.org/specifications/dublin-core/dcmi-type-vocabulary/#Text> ;
    skos:definition "A resource consisting primarily of words for reading that is not covered by any other textual resource type in this list." ;
